[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13141.59, "timestamp": "03:39:01", "text": "メニュー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13174.309, "timestamp": "03:39:34", "text": "また、あなたがプレイしたので"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13176.87, "timestamp": "03:39:36", "text": "このゲーム、手伝ってくれてありがとう。は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13181.429, "timestamp": "03:39:41", "text": "私が撮った写真を削除する方法はありますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13182.83, "timestamp": "03:39:42", "text": "舵"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13185.91, "timestamp": "03:39:45", "text": "あれ？私が舵を取った。それは私に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13189.19, "timestamp": "03:39:49", "text": "えっと、ちょっと待ってください。私は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13192.75, "timestamp": "03:39:52", "text": "この焼き魚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13196.59, "timestamp": "03:39:56", "text": "下。置くよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13199.51, "timestamp": "03:39:59", "text": "ここ。アイテムを落とすにはどうすればいいですか？ああ、"}]